From 70d81a6d22045af9c2202d09f7ae5671e82e83a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 08:27:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test: characterization goldens for markup, words, storage
 and dice draws
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Four golden suites in src/__tests__/golden/ (round.md §3.2, C-a's share), new files
only, written on today's code with commit 2's kit: C1 markup (110 tests: GameTable at
each seat and state, CharacterPane per tab, its menus, dialogs and toasts, and the maps'
states: the U1 settle matrix, U2 layouts, picker and popovers, V1 chat lines, tracker,
live status, full screen, turn toast, V2 journal, party, campaigns and the pages),
C4 words (104: briefOf and reasons per kind, state and seat, toast and tray words, chat
lines, subtitles and tab names, the turn panel and toast, the word utilities, the save
titles), C7 storage (21: both storages' raw keys and values after each gesture, rows
written per command kind, the hello's campaign row) and C8 dice draws (29:
useSheetRoller per roll shape over the fixed LCG, Math.random counts, bodies posted).

Snapshots (266) written once with --ci=false over these four files only, then green
twice with --ci; eslint clean. React ids and times by the kit's normalizers;
crypto.randomUUID numbered per test, the roller's counters by first appearance, and
each test's own character id, so a test reads the same alone as in its file.

Mutation spot-checks, each reverted: a class in the roll menu's portal (C1: 5 named
tests red), the reaction reason's word (C4: reasons(player), reasons(gm)), the creature
key stored (C7: the creature chosen at the table), the d20's pool (C8: the four d20
shapes).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
